    "summary.md": "# Last Done\n\nTrack household chores and mark them done in one tap.\n\n- **Target user:** Someone keeping up with recurring chores\n- **Build route:** compile\n- **Genome:** tracker\n- **Persistence:** browser-local storage\n- **Start:** `npm run dev` → http://localhost:3000\n\n## Verified journeys\n\n- Application loads and shows a useful empty state\n- Invalid activity input shows validation without crashing\n- User can add a complete activity and see it in activities\n- activities survive a page refresh\n- User can edit an existing activity\n- User can search activities\n- User can narrow activities with a meaningful filter\n- activities are grouped by a meaningful category or status\n- Requested derived values update from persisted records\n- User can delete an existing activity\n- A one-tap action updates a activity field and persists\n"
  },
